      "object_id": "mathia_synthesis_61d1b1bef4d35aebbbdf9eb79de4c838fb8f45ff73b4b59489e3c6dfc81d58c6",
      "object_role": "synthesis",
      "proposed_content": "The fourth-moment argument realizes an Atkinson-style diagonal/off-diagonal program through a stronger chain of representations: a four-variable meromorphic family exposes the kl=mn split, additive-twist contour manipulation converts the off-diagonal pieces into sign-separated Kloosterman kernels, and a corrected Kuznetsov formula converts those kernels into automorphic spectral data.",
